# Reserved for future service configuration. Do not add secrets to this file.

# Live text generation requires GEMINI_API_KEY in the trusted deployment.
# GEMINI_TEXT_MODEL defaults to gemini-3.8-flash. Demo mode needs no secrets.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL and UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN optionally add a
# deployment-wide request limiter; Gemini provider quotas remain the fallback.
# Voice still requires a separate OPENAI_API_KEY and durable limiter.
# OPENAI_TRANSCRIBE_MODEL defaults to gpt-transcribe.
# OPENAI_SPEECH_MODEL defaults temporarily to gpt-4o-mini-tts; migrate this
# adapter to gpt-realtime-2.1-mini before its scheduled 2027-01-06 shutdown.
